sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Pinia Store
    participant Worker as Sync Host
    participant SQLite as Local Storage
    participant Server as Servidor JMAP

    Server->>Worker: WS: StateChange (Email: "new123")
    
    Worker->>SQLite: Lee último State local
    SQLite-->>Worker: sinceState: "old456"
    
    Worker->>Server: Email/changes (sinceState: "old456")
    Server-->>Worker: updated: [id_2], destroyed: [id_3], newState: "new123"
    
    opt Si hay correos nuevos/actualizados
        Worker->>Server: Email/get (ids: [id_2])
        Server-->>Worker: Propiedades de id_2
        Worker->>SQLite: Actualiza id_2 en caché
    end
    
    opt Si hay borrados
        Worker->>SQLite: Borra id_3 (Cascade delete)
    end
    
    Worker->>SQLite: Guarda nuevo State "new123"
    Worker-->>UI: TABLES_TOUCHED
    UI->>SQLite: Recarga vista
